---

This project queries the ClinicalTrials.gov API (https://clinicaltrials.gov),
a public data source maintained by the U.S. National Library of Medicine. Trial
data returned by that API is not covered by this license.

The US zip code data in db/seeds/zip_codes.csv comes from GeoNames
(https://www.geonames.org), licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). It is not covered by this
license.
